/**
 * Cloud Foundation Fabric (CFF) Module Variant for Stage 0 (Bootstrap)
 *
 * If you are working directly with the official Cloud Foundation Fabric repository,
 * FAST Stage 0 uses high-level CFF modules (`project`, `gcs`, and `iam-service-account`)
 * instead of raw Terraform resources.
 *
 * Below is how the seed automation project, state buckets, and service accounts are
 * configured using Cloud Foundation Fabric modules:
 */

